summary.example:
The following example demonstrates how language support is achieved by generating an exception.  As is 
demonstrated, ExtractMPQNumber throws an exception because an invalid parameter is passed:


using System;
using System.Threading;
using MBNCSUtil;
namespace mbncsutil_test
{
	class Class1
	{
		[STAThread]
		static void Main(string[] args)
		{
			int val = CheckRevision.ExtractMPQNumber("blah");
	
			Console.ReadLine();
		}
	}
}

However, by changing the thread's current culture, another language is achieved:

using System;
using System.Threading;
using MBNCSUtil;
namespace mbncsutil_test
{
	class Class1
	{
		[STAThread]
		static void Main(string[] args)
		{
			Thread.CurrentThread.CurrentUICulture = new System.Globalization.CultureInfo("es");
			
			int val = CheckRevision.ExtractMPQNumber("blah");
	
			Console.ReadLine();
		}
	}
}

